        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mr. T, Jeff Fahey, Gary Busey, Carol Alt, Tony Nappo, Howie Mandel, Margot Kidder, Corbin Bernsen, Lawrence Tureaud\n- Projects: Apocalypse (film series), The A-Team, Rocky III\n- Roles: B. A. Baracus, Clubber Lang\n\nFacts:\n- Mr. T was born as Lawrence Tureaud on May 21, 1952.\n- Mr. T is an American actor and retired professional wrestler.\n- Mr. T played boxer Clubber Lang in the 1982 film Rocky III.\n- Mr. T is known for playing B. A. Baracus in the 1980s television series The A-Team.\n- Mr. T was among the other cast members in the Apocalypse film series.\n- Other cast members in the Apocalypse film series included Jeff Fahey, Gary Busey, Carol Alt, Tony Nappo, Howie Mandel, Margot Kidder, and Corbin Bernsen.",
